<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Hartford target raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Hartford target raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said analyst Charles Gates raised his 12-month price target for Hartford Financial Services Group Inc to $100 from $84.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Hartford Financial closed Thursday at 77-3/8.</p>
